blurb = "Depicts a basket ferry in Hida Province (present-day northern Gifu prefecture). Depicts men using ropes to pull travelers in baskets between two platforms to cross a deep river gorge.

The earliest mentions of aerial ropeways in Japanese history are found in the Taiheiki (Chronicle of The Great Peace), written in the late 14th century."
